lor:#7C3AED;flex-shrink:0;font-family:Space Grotesk,sans-serif;font-weight:700">C</span><div><b style="font-size:14px;display:block;color:#0E0D12">Another Clinic</b><span style="color:#FFB800;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1px">★★★</span> <span style="font-size:11.5px;color:#5D5B66">3.6 (24)</span></div></div>								</div>
