		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-30ff87b e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent" data-id="30ff87b" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container" data-settings="{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}">
					<div class="e-con-inner">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-7df64578 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="7df64578" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
									<p style="font-family:Space Grotesk,sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:12.5px;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#7C3AED;margin:0"><span style="display:inline-block;width:22px;height:3px;background:linear-gradient(100deg,#FF2E7E,#7C3AED);border-radius:2px;margin-right:8px;vertical-align:middle"></span>Why niche wins</p>								</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-1203bdf3 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="1203bdf3" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
					<h2 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">The compliance shift <span class="hl">every plastic surgery clinic needs to know about</span></h2>				</div>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-1f7b36f2 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="1f7b36f2" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-3efae829 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="3efae829" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-797af396 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="797af396" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
									<p>Plastic surgery is not a lighter version of aesthetic clinic marketing — it&#8217;s a surgical, months-long patient journey with a fundamentally different advertising rulebook, and that rulebook just got a lot stricter. In September 2026, Dubai Health Authority moved to discipline aesthetic clinics over edited before/after images and unsubstantiated claims, and the change reaches further than most clinics realize.</p>								</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-57db78db elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="57db78db" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
					<h3 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Clinics are now liable for content they didn't even film</h3>				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-8702797 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="8702797" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
									<p>Under the new standard, healthcare facilities are responsible for promotional material filmed on their premises — including content shot on a patient&#8217;s or influencer&#8217;s personal device. That reshapes how influencer visits, patient testimonials and even casual social content need to be managed.</p>								</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-35ed4c25 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="35ed4c25" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
					<h3 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Before/after photos have a specific, checkable standard now</h3>				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-3cf8c8b3 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="3cf8c8b3" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
									<p>Images are only compliant if they show the same patient, photographed with identical equipment, with no digital editing, accompanied by written consent and realistic outcome descriptions with risk disclosures. Exaggerated language — &#8220;best,&#8221; &#8220;safest,&#8221; &#8220;guaranteed,&#8221; &#8220;immediate results&#8221; — is explicitly targeted.</p>								</div>
				</div>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-553196ed e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="553196ed" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container" data-settings="{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-c039670 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="c039670" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
									<p style="font-family:Space Grotesk,sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:18px;color:#fff;margin:0 0 14px">Plastic surgery, at a glance</p><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;padding:12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12);font-size:14px;color:#D9D5E4"><b style="font-family:Space Grotesk,sans-serif;color:#C6F432;min-width:130px">Sep 2026</b><span>— DHA circular on aesthetic advertising standards</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;padding:12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12);font-size:14px;color:#D9D5E4"><b style="font-family:Space Grotesk,sans-serif;color:#C6F432;min-width:130px">3-6 months</b><span>— typical research-to-surgery decision window</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;padding:12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12);font-size:14px;color:#D9D5E4"><b style="font-family:Space Grotesk,sans-serif;color:#C6F432;min-width:130px">AED 15-55K</b><span>— real Dubai procedure price range</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;padding:12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12);font-size:14px;color:#D9D5E4"><b style="font-family:Space Grotesk,sans-serif;color:#C6F432;min-width:130px">Clinic liable</b><span>— for content filmed anywhere on premises</span></div><div style="background:#FFF9E9;border:1px solid #F0DFA0;border-radius:16px;padding:22px 24px;margin-top:22px"><div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font-family:Space Grotesk,sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;color:#7A5D0A;margin-bottom:10px">&#9888;&#65039; Compliance note</div><p style="font-size:13px;color:#7A5D0A;line-height:1.6;margin:0">Every before/after asset, testimonial and claim we produce is written to the DHA&#8217;s September 2026 standard. This page is not legal advice — we recommend your clinic&#8217;s compliance officer or legal counsel signs off on final campaign copy before launch.</p></div>								</div>
				</div>
				</div>
					</div>
				</div>
