														</span>
												<a class="elementor-accordion-title" tabindex="0">What actually changed with the September 2026 DHA circular?</a>
					</div>
					<div id="elementor-tab-content-6721" class="elementor-tab-content elementor-clearfix" data-tab="1" role="region" aria-labelledby="elementor-tab-title-6721"><p>DHA moved to discipline aesthetic clinics over misleading before/after images (edited, different angles or lighting), exaggerated language like &#8220;best&#8221; or &#8220;guaranteed,&#8221; unsubstantiated outcome claims, and unauthorized patient content — and made clinics liable for anything filmed on their premises, including on a patient&#8217;s or influencer&#8217;s personal device.</p></div>
				</div>
							<div class="elementor-accordion-item">
					<div id="elementor-tab-title-6722" class="elementor-tab-title" data-tab="2" role="button" aria-controls="elementor-tab-content-6722" aria-expanded="false">
													<span class="elementor-accordion-icon elementor-accordion-icon-left" aria-hidden="true">
															<span class="elementor-accordion-icon-closed"><svg class="e-font-icon-svg e-fas-plus" viewBox="0 0 448 512" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M416 208H272V64c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32h-32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v144H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h144v144c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V304h144c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z"></path></svg></span>
								<span class="elementor-accordion-icon-opened"><svg class="e-font-icon-svg e-fas-minus" viewBox="0 0 448 512" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M416 208H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h384c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z"></path></svg></span>
														</span>
												<a class="elementor-accordion-title" tabindex="0">What makes a before/after photo compliant now?</a>
					</div>
					<div id="elementor-tab-content-6722" class="elementor-tab-content elementor-clearfix" data-tab="2" role="region" aria-labelledby="elementor-tab-title-6722"><p>The same patient, photographed with identical equipment, with no digital editing, accompanied by written consent and a realistic outcome description with risk disclosures.</p></div>
				</div>
							<div class="elementor-accordion-item">
					<div id="elementor-tab-title-6723" class="elementor-tab-title" data-tab="3" role="button" aria-controls="elementor-tab-content-6723" aria-expanded="false">
